%R	37475	1916806	72	13033	<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC ""-//W3C//DTD HTML 4.0 Transitional//EN""><HTML><HEAD><META content=""text/html; charset=unicode"" http-equiv=Content-Type><META name=GENERATOR content=""MSHTML 11.00.10570.1001""></HEAD><BODY>Original intent was to be able to work in 3 blocks, with underground work completed. Bus impacts not allowing for work to occur in the sequence planned.</BODY></HTML>
%R	37476	1918960	72	13033	<!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC ""-//W3C//DTD HTML 4.0 Transitional//EN""><HTML><HEAD><META content=""text/html; charset=unicode"" http-equiv=Content-Type><META name=GENERATOR content=""MSHTML 11.00.10570.1001""></HEAD><BODY>Work has not been able to begin on this work due to TCP delays and then because of the detour route for paving on Madison Street.</BODY></HTML>
